WEBVTT

00:11:56.722 --> 00:12:00.142
and I beg them,
I beseech them to just stop it.

00:12:01.528 --> 00:12:03.033
But I think that's unlikely.

00:12:03.509 --> 00:12:07.048
So we are so lucky that we have resources

00:12:07.072 --> 00:12:10.206
like the Internet, where we can
circumvent these institutions

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.286
from the bottom up.

00:12:13.593 --> 00:12:16.481
There's a growing number
of online resources

00:12:16.505 --> 00:12:19.807
that are dedicated
to just explaining science

00:12:19.831 --> 00:12:22.497
in simple, understandable ways.

00:12:22.934 --> 00:12:25.290
I dream of a Wikipedia-like website

00:12:25.314 --> 00:12:29.013
that would explain
any scientific concept you can think of

00:12:29.037 --> 00:12:32.648
in simple language
any middle schooler can understand.